From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:41:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 26/30] Define exact supervisor termination acknowledgements
 and receipts

A protected actor must not be deleted until its runtime proves the exact
activation stopped. Add the acknowledgement the worker returns from
termination, the receipt committed with deletion, and the activation
carried to the worker with the workload spec. ReadSupervisorTermination
returns the receipt; its name uses a custom verb because the API rules
reserve Get for the one-to-one resource getter. The registry authorizes
it as a read of the actor.

Fork-Topic: supervisor-termination
Fork-Upstream: fork-only
